# {{title}} — Pi runtime

Pi appends this file to the project system prompt, so it is the one Pi reads —
the name is the contract, not a convention. This workspace is a deterministic
projection of the `.claude/` SSOT, generated by `papersmith` {{version}}.

Read `papersmith.yaml`, `guidance/paper-guide/`, and the applicable
`skills/*/SKILL.md` before working on the paper.

